config BR2_PACKAGE_CAMILLADSP
	bool "camilladsp"
	depends on BR2_USE_MMU # Rust
	select BR2_PACKAGE_ALSA_LIB
	select BR2_PACKAGE_UCODE
	help
	  CamillaDSP is a flexible audio processing engine for
	  crossovers, room correction etc. (ALSA backend, websocket
	  control, 32-bit float processing). Ships camilladsp-genconf
	  (ucode: runtime config generated from uci), the procd init
	  script and uci defaults; boards override the defaults via
	  their rootfs overlay where needed.

	  https://github.com/HEnquist/camilladsp
